linuxdroid-desktop-environment (1.0.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * D15: Production packaging release — D0–D14 complete.
  * Full Wayland shell: launcher, dock, switcher, home, system UI, notifications, settings.
  * D14 performance hardening: bounded SHM buffer pooling, selective dirty rendering,
    zero-allocation launcher search, O(1) window registry lookups, debounced settings persistence.
  * D13 settings subsystem: centralized persistent configuration with live reload.
  * D12 notifications: D-Bus org.freedesktop.Notifications implementation.
  * Wayland session entry installed to /usr/share/wayland-sessions/ldde.desktop.
  * System config installed to /etc/linuxdroid/desktop.conf (preserved on upgrade).
  * CPack DEB packaging support added.

 -- LinuxDroid Team <hello@linuxdroid.dev>  Sat, 06 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000
